  // without @map, so the Prisma client emitted quoted camelCase column
  // names ("billingPlan", "billingStatus", "includedSeats", "overSeatLimit").
  // No migration ever created snake_case columns for them — production has
  // been running on camelCase columns minted by an early `prisma db push`.
  // The Phase 32.6.3 repair migration creates the snake_case columns and
  // backfills from the camelCase residue. See migration
  // 20260620300000_team_billing_naming_drift_repair.
  billingPlan            PlanType                       @default(FREE) @map("billing_plan")
  billingStatus          TeamBillingStatus              @default(INACTIVE) @map("billing_status")
